{"id":"91e8e33f97b41a1cc1ba186c1ba65088387b9d8e","url":"https://www.nuet.ai/","title":"Nuet – Your Parent Assistant | Family Calendar for Parents","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"www.nuet.ai","byline":"Nuet Team","excerpt":"Nuet is your parent assistant — it gathers events from emails, photos, and voice, organises your family calendar, and surfaces what you need to know. No charge for 7 days.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"__next\"><header></header><div><div><p>Your parent assistant</p><h2>Plan less.<br><span>Live more.</span></h2><p>Turn emails, WhatsApp groups, and photos into calendar events — before you even think to add them.</p><div><div><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6747891128\"><img src=\"https://toolbox.marketingtools.apple.com/api/v2/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?releaseDate=1755216000\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"eager\"></a></p></div><p>Free for 7 days. Cancel anytime.</p></div><div><p><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span></p><p><span>5.0 on the App Store</span><span>·</span><span>Join parents with one less thing to worry about</span></p></div><div><p><a href=\"https://www.madeformums.com/tech-awards-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Gold Winner - Best Parenting App, MadeForMums Tech Awards 2026\"><img alt=\"Gold Winner - Best Parenting App, MadeForMums Tech Awards 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=96&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=256&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=256&q=75\"></a></p><p><span>Gold Winner</span><br><span>MadeForMums Tech Awards 2026</span></p></div></div><div><p><img alt=\"Nuet Today view showing your family schedule\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"800\" height=\"1600\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" src=\"/screenshots/optimized/hero-today-800.webp\"></p></div></div><div><div><p>How it works</p><h2>Set up in two minutes.<span> Then it just works.</span></h2></div><div><article><span>01</span><h3>Connect your sources</h3><p>Email (Gmail, Outlook, iCloud, Yahoo) and WhatsApp group chats — all in one place.</p><div><p><img alt=\"Connect your email accounts and WhatsApp in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Your assistant gets to work</h3><p>Nuet finds dates, events, and deadlines. Nothing else.</p><div><p><img alt=\"Nuet surfaces events found in your inbox\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Your calendar, complete</h3><p>Lands in Google, Outlook, or iCloud — your calendar, already complete.</p><div><p><img alt=\"Monthly calendar view with family events in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article></div></div><div><div><p>Capture</p><h2>Less noise.<br>More clarity.</h2><p>We gather everything in one place, so you don't have to keep it in your head.</p><ul><li><img alt=\"Screenshot a message\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcamera.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcamera.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcamera.png&w=96&q=75\"><div><p>Screenshot a message</p><p>iMessage, texts, group chats — anything with a date.</p></div></li><li><img alt=\"Forward any email\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75\"><div><p>Forward any email</p><p>Flights, hotels, reservations — forwarded and done.</p></div></li><li><img alt=\"Record a voice memo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fmicrophone.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fmicrophone.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fmicrophone.png&w=96&q=75\"><div><p>Record a voice memo</p><p>Say “dentist Thursday at 3pm” and it’s on your calendar.</p></div></li><li><img alt=\"Snap a photo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fupload-photo.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fupload-photo.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fupload-photo.png&w=96&q=75\"><div><p>Snap a photo</p><p>Newsletters, posters, fridge notes — captured in seconds.</p></div></li></ul></div><div><p><img alt=\"Add events by screenshot, email, voice, or photo in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></div><div><div><p>Privacy</p><h2>Private by design at its core</h2><p>You stay in control. Nuet reads only what you allow.</p></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"Enterprise-grade encryption\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>Enterprise-grade encryption</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"No emails stored on our servers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>No emails stored on our servers</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"You choose which senders to monitor\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>You choose which senders to monitor</p></div></div></div><div><p>Stories</p><h2>What people say</h2></div><div><blockquote>I'm a dad of three. I was spending hours every week managing calendar admin — copying dates from emails, searching inboxes, managing WhatsApp messages. I wanted that time back.<!-- --> <span>Time to actually be present with my kids.</span> So I assembled a team of parents who share this obsession, and we built Nuet.</blockquote></div><div><h2>Plan less.<br>Live more.</h2><p>No charge for 7 days. Cancel anytime.</p><div><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6747891128\"><img src=\"https://toolbox.marketingtools.apple.com/api/v2/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?releaseDate=1755216000\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p></div></div></div></DIV>","content_text":"Your parent assistantPlan less.Live more.Turn emails, WhatsApp groups, and photos into calendar events — before you even think to add them.Free for 7 days. Cancel anytime.★★★★★5.0 on the App Store·Join parents with one less thing to worry aboutGold WinnerMadeForMums Tech Awards 2026How it worksSet up in two minutes. Then it just works.01Connect your sourcesEmail (Gmail, Outlook, iCloud, Yahoo) and WhatsApp group chats — all in one place.02Your assistant gets to workNuet finds dates, events, and deadlines. Nothing else.03Your calendar, completeLands in Google, Outlook, or iCloud — your calendar, already complete.CaptureLess noise.More clarity.We gather everything in one place, so you don't have to keep it in your head.Screenshot a messageiMessage, texts, group chats — anything with a date.Forward any emailFlights, hotels, reservations — forwarded and done.Record a voice memoSay “dentist Thursday at 3pm” and it’s on your calendar.Snap a photoNewsletters, posters, fridge notes — captured in seconds.PrivacyPrivate by design at its coreYou stay in control. Nuet reads only what you allow.Enterprise-grade encryptionNo emails stored on our serversYou choose which senders to monitorStoriesWhat people sayI'm a dad of three. I was spending hours every week managing calendar admin — copying dates from emails, searching inboxes, managing WhatsApp messages. I wanted that time back. Time to actually be present with my kids. So I assembled a team of parents who share this obsession, and we built Nuet.Plan less.Live more.No charge for 7 days. Cancel anytime.","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T17:22:10.868Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>Your parent assistant</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Your paren