api/v2/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?releaseDate=1755216000\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"eager\"></a></p></div><p>Free for 7 days. 随时取消。</p></div><div><p><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span></p><p>5.0 on the App Store·Join parents with one less thing to worry about</p></div><div><p><a href=\"https://www.madeformums.com/tech-awards-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Gold Winner - Best Parenting App, MadeForMums Tech Awards 2026\"><img alt=\"Gold Winner - Best Parenting App, MadeForMums Tech Awards 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=96&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=256&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fmadeformums-gold-2026.webp&w=256&q=75\"></a></p><p>Gold WinnerMadeForMums Tech Awards 2026</p></div></div><div><p><img alt=\"Nuet Today view showing your family schedule\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"800\" height=\"1600\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" src=\"/screenshots/optimized/hero-today-800.webp\"></p></div></div><div><div><p>它是如何运作的</p><h2>Set up in two minutes. Then it just works.</h2></div><div><article><span>01</span><h3>Connect your sources</h3><p>Email (Gmail, Outlook, iCloud, Yahoo) and WhatsApp group chats — all in one place.</p><div><p><img alt=\"Connect your email accounts and WhatsApp in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fconsent-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Your assistant gets to work</h3><p>Nuet finds dates, events, and deadlines. 没有别的了。</p><div><p><img alt=\"Nuet surfaces events found in your inbox\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fevent-notification-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Your calendar, complete</h3><p>Lands in Google, Outlook, or iCloud — your calendar, already complete.</p><div><p><img alt=\"Monthly calendar view with family events in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fmonthly-view-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></article></div></div><div><div><p>捕获</p><h2>Less noise.More clarity.</h2><p>We gather everything in one place, so you don't have to keep it in your head.</p><ul><li>Screenshot a messageiMessage, texts, group chats — anything with a date.</li><li>Forward any emailFlights, hotels, reservations — forwarded and done.</li><li>Record a voice memoSay “dentist Thursday at 3pm” and it’s on your calendar.</li><li>Snap a photoNewsletters, posters, fridge notes — captured in seconds.</li></ul></div><div><p><img alt=\"Add events by screenshot, email, voice, or photo in Nuet\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"1200\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 300px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=640&q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=750&q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=828&q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1080&q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1200&q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=1920&q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=2048&q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=3840&q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Fscreenshots%2Foptimized%2Fupload-600.webp&w=3840&q=75\"></p></div></div><div><div><p>隐私</p><h2>Private by design at its core</h2><p>您保持掌控。 Nuet reads only what you allow.</p></div><div><div><p><img alt=\"Enterprise-grade encryption\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fpadlock.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>Enterprise-grade encryption</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"No emails stored on our servers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Femail.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>No emails stored on our servers</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"You choose which senders to monitor\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcSet=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=48&q=75 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=96&q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image/?url=%2Ficons%2Fcheckmark.png&w=96&q=75\"></p><p>You choose which senders to monitor</p></div></div></div><div><p>Stories</p><h2>人们怎么说</h2></div><div><blockquote>I'm a dad of three. I was spending hours every week managing calendar admin — copying dates from emails, searching inboxes, managing WhatsApp messages. I wanted that time back. Time to actually be present with my kids. So I assembled a team of parents who share this obsession, and we built Nuet.</blockquote></div><div><h2>Plan less.Live more.</h2><p>No charge for 7 days. 随时取消。</p><div><p><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6747891128\"><img src=\"https://toolbox.marketingtools.apple.com/api/v2/badges/download-on-the-app-store/black/en-us?releaseDate=1755216000\" alt=\"Download on the App Store\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p></div></div></div></div>"}